      {
        "n": "LA MANO W/ LECHUGA ZAFIRO - IGNICIÓN pt 2",
        "s": "2026-11-05T01:00:00Z",
        "e": "2026-11-05T02:00:00Z",
        "d": "Uruguay DJ, producer and sound designer Lechuga Zafiro presents “La Mano” (The Hand). It is an ode to the creative hands of the world. Hands that translate ideas and modify sound: hit the drum, touch the knobs, excite the strings. “La Mano” is always recorded live on CDJS and DJMs. Five fingers for rhythm, texture, weirdness, acoustic phenomena and sabor. Five fingers for each stroke of “La Clave”.\nFrom the host: \"Part 2 of the “Ignición” mix, and the last show of the year. “Ignición” is about finding my own voice in techno — an experiment in exploring how it connects with the rhythms I'm fascinated by, like candombe and guaguancó. Part 1 is on La Mano's show page. Always recorded live on 3 CDJs and a DJM.\"",
        "j": null,
        "u": "https://www.nts.live/api/v2/shows/lechuga-zafiro/episodes/lechuga-zafiro-5th-november-2026"
      },
